<title>USA: Conseco closes Capitol American merger.</title>
<headline>Conseco closes Capitol American merger.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Tuesday it completed its merger with Capitol American Financial Corp, which was combined with a subsidiary of the insurance holding company.</p>
<p>The stock-and-cash transaction had been threatened by a shareholder lawsuit filed in Arizona, but a judge Tuesday ruled in favor of the lawsuit, citing insufficient evidence.</p>
<p>Conseco shares were off 1/2 Tuesday at 39-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
